{"id":"na1d1e8e3a2","headline":"India’s April-May fiscal deficit at 9.6% of full-year target","summary":"India's fiscal deficit in April-May was 1.62 trillion rupees, or 9.6% of the estimate for the financial year ending March 31, government data showed. The deficit in the same period last year was also reported.","why":"The fiscal deficit measures the gap between government spending and revenue, and it shapes borrowing needs and bond supply. Investors watch it closely for India's sovereign debt and rupee outlook.","category":"economy","event_type":"macro-data","importance":2,"flag":null,"market_moving":false,"location":{"place":"New Delhi","country":"India","lat":28.61,"lon":77.21,"region":"asia"},"entities":[],"links":[],"source":{"name":"93.3 The Drive","url":"https://www.933thedrive.com/2026/06/30/indias-april-may-fiscal-deficit-at-9-6-of-full-year-target/"},"sources":[{"name":"93.3 The Drive","url":"https://www.933thedrive.com/2026/06/30/indias-april-may-fiscal-deficit-at-9-6-of-full-year-target/"}],"published_at":"2026-06-30T11:02:00Z","retrieved_at":"2026-11-17T13:38:59Z","official":false,"ai_summary":true,"content_hash":"45e8f465382b87fc","impacts":[],"why_moved":null,"backfilled":true,"backfilled_at":"2026-11-17T13:38:59Z","backfill_provenance":{"version":"gdelt-backfill-v1","original_published_at":"2026-06-30T11:02:00Z","feed_url":"https://data.gdeltproject.org/gdeltv2/","discovered_via":"GDELT GKG 2.1","gdelt_seen":"2026-06-30T12:00:00Z","publisher_country_gdelt":"IN","description_from":"publisher page metadata"},"image":{"kind":"topic","file":"photos/parliament-government-building-7202373.jpg","alt":"parliament government building (illustration)","credit":"niki_emmert","license":"Pixabay Content License","license_url":"https://pixabay.com/service/license-summary/","source":"Pixabay","source_url":"https://pixabay.com/photos/hungarian-parliament-building-7202373/"}}